WEBVTT

01:40.570 --> 01:41.810
Thank you.

01:45.090 --> 01:48.610
That place you destroyed

01:49.970 --> 01:53.350
wasn't worth protecting to begin with.

01:54.670 --> 01:57.150
And you freed Lily-sama from it.

01:58.080 --> 02:02.910
All I could do was watch helplessly.

02:03.710 --> 02:06.560
Thank you for saving me.

02:09.580 --> 02:12.870
<i>I never should have thrown myself 
into that situation.</i>

02:14.110 --> 02:16.050
<i>It meant helping the angels.</i>

02:16.770 --> 02:18.910
<i>It was the worst thing 
I could have done as a demon.</i>

02:20.360 --> 02:21.420
<i>Besides...</i>

02:22.020 --> 02:25.510
<i>All I did was run around, 
lose control, and make a mess.</i>

02:26.920 --> 02:27.690
<i>But...</i>

02:29.310 --> 02:31.320
<i>It wasn't a mistake, was it?</i>

02:33.350 --> 02:34.270
Hey...

02:36.300 --> 02:38.180
There's a woman crying here.

02:38.690 --> 02:40.220
At least pat my head.

02:43.970 --> 02:46.100
You're a man. Isn't that 
the least you could do?

02:46.500 --> 02:49.230
You can hold me if you'd like, too.

02:49.450 --> 02:52.000
N-Nah, that's a bit...

02:52.000 --> 02:53.480
Then pat my head. Now.

02:54.540 --> 02:56.370
<i>What is she going on about?</i>

02:58.540 --> 02:59.400
Hurry.

03:00.170 --> 03:01.240
<i>Shut up.</i>

03:01.950 --> 03:03.240
Hurry up!

03:03.940 --> 03:06.330
<i>It doesn't look like 
she's going to let this go.</i>

03:08.090 --> 03:11.450
<i>I guess putting my hand 
on her head isn't so bad.</i>

03:13.800 --> 03:15.840
Final flash!

03:19.850 --> 03:20.810
Good.

03:20.810 --> 03:22.130
It came out well.

03:22.510 --> 03:24.610
I love the Beta 7-4.

03:24.610 --> 03:26.540
Why are you taking pictures?

03:26.540 --> 03:28.140
Just gathering some material.

03:28.810 --> 03:29.890
Ah...

03:29.890 --> 03:31.940
And now I upload it to my smartphone.

03:32.460 --> 03:33.430
Material?

03:34.270 --> 03:37.250
If you don't want Lily-sama to see this photo,

03:37.250 --> 03:40.490
you'll continue to serve 
as her shield going forward.

03:42.940 --> 03:43.680
You!

03:43.680 --> 03:45.770
Was everything you said up until now a lie?!

03:45.770 --> 03:49.090
I was serious, but I came up 
with this idea just now.

03:49.090 --> 03:50.360
It was a good opportunity.

03:50.360 --> 03:51.170
You...

03:52.140 --> 03:54.830
Wait, are you sure you
can show that to Amane?

03:55.390 --> 03:57.350
Wouldn't you be the one in trouble then?

04:03.830 --> 04:06.430
<i>She really cares about Amane.</i>

04:07.340 --> 04:12.310
<i>Because she's her avatar, of course, 
but I bet that's not all of it.</i>

04:13.780 --> 04:17.130
<i>She definitely took after her odd personality.</i>

04:17.130 --> 04:18.820
H-Hey...

04:19.120 --> 04:20.230
So...

04:20.670 --> 04:22.980
In return for having saved Lily-sama...

04:23.960 --> 04:25.820
How about a squeeze?

04:28.570 --> 04:31.290
Don't say that like you're 
some dude from a sketchy shop!

04:31.290 --> 04:32.210
Wh-What?!

04:32.210 --> 04:33.610
I'm not squeezing them.

04:33.610 --> 04:34.950
You'll just take another picture!

04:42.050 --> 04:43.420
Where am I?

04:45.090 --> 04:47.930
I've changed clothes, too.

04:49.660 --> 04:51.270
Hey, you're up.

04:52.780 --> 04:54.160
Want something to eat?

04:54.160 --> 04:55.650
I only have frozen food.

04:55.650 --> 04:56.930
<i>Akutsu...</i>

04:56.930 --> 04:58.150
<i>Why is he here?</i>

04:59.300 --> 05:01.930
<i>No, this must be his place.</i>

05:02.650 --> 05:06.570
<i>Which means I could only 
have changed clothes...</i>

05:08.090 --> 05:09.490
<i>Because of Akutsu!</i>

05:10.740 --> 05:11.950
<b>Wet hair</b>

05:11.990 --> 05:15.000
<b>Satisfied
look</b>

05:13.250 --> 05:15.000
<b>Toothbrush</b>

05:15.500 --> 05:17.090
<i>No, it can't be.</i>

05:17.090 --> 05:18.470
<i>There's no way.</i>

05:19.620 --> 05:21.490
<i>A-Am I wearing...</i>

05:25.570 --> 05:27.220
<i>I'm not.</i>

05:27.880 --> 05:29.340
What's wrong?

05:29.340 --> 05:30.600
Are you hurting anywhere?

05:41.070 --> 05:43.500
How dare...

05:43.500 --> 05:48.900
How dare! How dare!

05:48.900 --> 05:49.910
W-Wait!

05:49.910 --> 05:52.020
You're making some kind of mistake!

05:55.080 --> 05:56.730
Silence!

05:56.730 --> 06:01.130
How dare you take my purity!

05:58.180 --> 05:58.940
Hold it!

06:01.130 --> 06:02.750
Lily-sama, Lily-sama...

06:03.460 --> 06:05.880
<b>I
did
it.</b>

06:03.460 --> 06:05.880
<b>Liliya</b>

06:06.490 --> 06:09.490
Pardon me for doing it 
while you were unconscious.

06:09.490 --> 06:12.510
I'm sorry for the late notice.

06:13.510 --> 06:17.640
<b>My purity</b>

06:13.510 --> 06:17.640
<b>My purity</b>

06:17.730 --> 06:22.650
She ded {sic}

06:25.320 --> 06:26.760
Jeez.

06:26.760 --> 06:28.360
You could have just listened.

06:28.860 --> 06:30.360
S-Sorry.

06:31.810 --> 06:34.870
So, are you hurting anywhere or anything?

06:35.330 --> 06:37.270
I-I'm fine.

06:37.530 --> 06:38.390
Yeah?

06:39.080 --> 06:39.940
Yeah.

06:44.460 --> 06:45.250
Hey...

06:47.170 --> 06:50.280
What happened after that?

06:51.250 --> 06:52.550
My brother...

06:53.390 --> 06:55.180
You and my brother...

06:55.180 --> 06:56.890
I didn't do anything to him.

06:57.410 --> 07:00.390
I had him leave right after.

07:00.390 --> 07:01.950
But I did give him a warning.

07:03.770 --> 07:05.490
I-I see.

07:06.180 --> 07:08.220
One more thing...

07:08.220 --> 07:10.510
Your appearance back there...

07:10.510 --> 07:11.780
Hold it.

07:12.200 --> 07:13.810
I told Liliya already...

07:14.260 --> 07:18.330
To be honest, I don't know 
why I took on that form.

07:18.750 --> 07:20.660
So please don't ask me yet.

07:21.320 --> 07:23.550
You don't?

07:26.390 --> 07:28.170
<i>Nii-sama left.</i>

07:28.170 --> 07:29.750
<i>Everything's been solved.</i>

07:30.390 --> 07:32.950
<i>So why am I still here?</i>

07:33.640 --> 07:34.970
Akutsu...

07:35.660 --> 07:36.900
Did you...

07:38.770 --> 07:40.060
Do you...

07:41.110 --> 07:43.940
You intend to have your way 
with me, don't you?!

07:44.190 --> 07:45.450
I do not!

07:45.450 --> 07:48.300
Th-Then did you put aphrodisi—

07:48.190 --> 07:50.190
<b>Aphrodisiac</b>

07:48.300 --> 07:49.420
I did not!

07:49.420 --> 07:51.620
Also, you mean hypnotic!

07:50.190 --> 07:50.900
<b>Hypnotic</b>

07:52.920 --> 07:57.310
If your brother sent backup 
to your place, you'd be in trouble.

07:58.500 --> 08:00.610
That's why I brought you to my place.

08:01.380 --> 08:02.390
Good point.

08:02.820 --> 08:03.960
See?

08:04.430 --> 08:09.720
Seriously, "aphrodisiac"? Where did you 
even pick up that word?

08:08.290 --> 08:10.670
<i>Honestly, I don't know.</i>

08:10.670 --> 08:14.760
<i>Akutsu really doesn't know about that form?</i>

08:17.930 --> 08:20.220
<i>He could be lying.</i>

08:20.680 --> 08:23.130
<i>Though, he doesn't seem like a good liar.</i>

08:23.940 --> 08:26.980
<i>But I've never heard of such power.</i>

08:27.710 --> 08:33.540
<i>All I can think of is that 
it's the demons' last resort.</i>

08:35.110 --> 08:36.260
<i>Right...</i>

08:36.740 --> 08:39.190
<i>If that's the case, 
that's important information.</i>

08:39.620 --> 08:46.290
<i>If I told them I stuck around him 
to study it further, I might be pardoned.</i>

08:47.310 --> 08:51.960
<i>I might get away with telling them that we 
fought Nii-sama to measure his power.</i>

08:52.920 --> 08:55.250
<i>That should solve everything.</i>

08:57.550 --> 08:58.680
<i>But...</i>

08:59.370 --> 09:01.290
Oh, yeah, Amane...

09:01.290 --> 09:02.350
What is it?

09:02.910 --> 09:04.970
This comes a bit late, but...

09:03.560 --> 09:06.180
<i>If there's just one problem...</i>

09:06.180 --> 09:07.980
You know when I was out of my mind?

09:07.980 --> 09:10.110
<i>It's that I don't know...</i>

09:10.840 --> 09:13.480
Thanks for helping me snap out of it.

09:17.370 --> 09:19.080
<i>I don't know...</i>

09:20.700 --> 09:22.310
<i>if I can bring myself to do that.</i>

09:26.060 --> 09:27.080
It's fine.

09:28.200 --> 09:30.350
Oh, look at the time.

09:30.790 --> 09:32.430
It's probably safe by now.

09:33.010 --> 09:34.900
You should head home
after you finish your drink.

09:34.900 --> 09:35.970
I'll walk you home.

09:44.040 --> 09:45.400
I'm...

09:46.190 --> 09:47.850
Say what?

09:47.850 --> 09:48.990
I can't hear you.

09:53.690 --> 09:55.530
I'm staying over.

09:58.920 --> 09:59.780
Huh?!

09:59.780 --> 10:01.280
What are you talking about?!

10:01.280 --> 10:02.990
That's not okay!

10:03.450 --> 10:06.090
My place is small, unlike yours.

10:06.750 --> 10:09.250
I only have one bed.

10:10.130 --> 10:13.620
Don't get the wrong idea, you pervert!

10:13.620 --> 10:17.920
I'm simply being cautious in case 
they've set up a trap at home!

10:17.920 --> 10:19.590
Angels can be persistent!

10:19.590 --> 10:21.610
I don't have the wrong idea!

10:21.610 --> 10:23.890
Do you even have any idea what you're saying?!

10:23.890 --> 10:25.230
Silence!

10:25.230 --> 10:26.770
It's a done deal!

10:27.270 --> 10:28.730
<b>Wha?</b>

10:28.730 --> 10:31.700
And <i>I'm</i> taking the bed!

10:31.700 --> 10:33.150
That's not a done deal!

10:33.150 --> 10:35.650
Also, are you telling me 
to sleep on the floor?!

10:35.650 --> 10:37.150
It'll be all right!

10:37.470 --> 10:41.160
I shall give you this duvet cover.

10:41.730 --> 10:42.810
You...

10:42.810 --> 10:45.970
Now that that's settled, 
it's time to go shopping.

10:46.440 --> 10:48.650
Liliya! Liliya!

10:48.650 --> 10:49.260
Yes?

10:49.260 --> 10:50.400
Hey, hold up!

10:50.400 --> 10:51.960
Go buy a change of clothes.

10:52.290 --> 10:53.540
Pajamas, too.

10:53.540 --> 10:55.050
And a toothbrush.

10:55.700 --> 10:58.190
Are there any shops open this late?

10:58.190 --> 10:59.530
It's fine.

10:59.530 --> 11:00.280
Go to **kyu.

10:59.680 --> 11:00.550
<b>**kyu</b>

11:00.280 --> 11:01.100
There aren't any.

11:01.690 --> 11:02.590
**lco, then.

11:01.970 --> 11:03.640
<b>**lco</b>

11:02.590 --> 11:04.040
There aren't any around here.

11:05.930 --> 11:07.240
I know!

11:06.930 --> 11:07.680
<b>**nki</b>

11:07.240 --> 11:09.650
Go to **nki! **nki!

11:07.680 --> 11:08.270
<b>**nki</b>

11:08.270 --> 11:22.280
<b>Power Bargain</b>

11:08.270 --> 11:22.280
Shampoo & Conditioner

11:08.270 --> 11:22.280
<b>set</b>

11:09.650 --> 11:11.610
Oh, you know the sleepover set?

11:11.610 --> 11:16.610
Buy that along with the usual
shampoo, conditioner, and lotion.

11:16.610 --> 11:19.320
Also, body soap and cleanser!

11:18.340 --> 11:20.630
This is a pain in the ass.

11:19.320 --> 11:21.480
My skin needs good care!

11:21.480 --> 11:22.890
O-Okay.

11:22.890 --> 11:23.950
I'll be going, then.

11:29.750 --> 11:33.180
Lily-sama, sleep well.

11:33.180 --> 11:34.430
Y-Yeah.

11:34.890 --> 11:37.950
Akutsu-dono, as per our agreement earlier...

11:38.420 --> 11:39.710
Take care of Lily-sama.

11:39.710 --> 11:41.300
Er, right.

11:41.830 --> 11:44.470
Now, then, if you'll excuse me...

11:54.030 --> 11:55.280
So, er, well...

11:55.280 --> 11:57.480
We have school tomorrow, 
so let's get ready to sleep.

11:57.770 --> 11:59.700
You don't need to tell me.

11:59.700 --> 12:01.990
I'll be occupying the bath for a moment.

12:03.500 --> 12:04.930
Don't you dare come in!

12:07.200 --> 12:08.900
Obviously!

12:15.980 --> 12:18.460
I guess I should at least report in.

12:20.260 --> 12:23.440
As the leader of the demons, 
I have a duty to protect our future.

12:23.440 --> 12:26.620
I need to take my work very seriously.

12:26.620 --> 12:28.280
Yes! This is awesome!

12:27.510 --> 12:30.640
Out-of-Office List

12:27.510 --> 12:30.640
Out-of-Office List

12:28.280 --> 12:30.640
These work clothes are fantastic!

12:32.060 --> 12:34.360
The boss isn't answering.

15:16.490 --> 15:18.180
Say, Akutsu...

15:19.700 --> 15:26.220
When Nii-sama had me on the ground, 
my mind was overtaken with fear.

15:29.780 --> 15:32.890
Even though I knew he wouldn't hurt me,

15:33.990 --> 15:37.550
the thought that Nee-sama 
was waiting after him...

15:38.330 --> 15:40.330
made me tremble uncontrollably.

15:44.610 --> 15:49.420
That's when I wished for you to help me.

15:51.210 --> 15:52.650
In my heart.

15:53.370 --> 15:54.420
Strongly.

15:58.220 --> 16:01.350
And you appeared.

16:02.170 --> 16:06.290
And you stood up against Nii-sama.

16:07.950 --> 16:10.340
My one and only servant came to me.

16:11.220 --> 16:14.730
My only demon.

16:17.460 --> 16:19.100
That's all it was.

16:19.960 --> 16:21.430
So I wonder why...

16:22.670 --> 16:25.350
Why was I so happy that I was in tears?

16:30.130 --> 16:34.230
I'm such a coward. This is 
the only way I can thank you.

16:34.670 --> 16:36.040
I'm sorry.

16:38.890 --> 16:44.660
But I really, really...

16:57.550 --> 16:59.530
appreciate you.

17:25.310 --> 17:27.060
I had fun.

17:27.370 --> 17:29.060
Yeah. So did I.

17:41.660 --> 17:42.790
Sheesh!

17:43.090 --> 17:45.970
You shouldn't have slept in! 
We're barely going to make it!

17:45.970 --> 17:47.500
That's my fault?!

17:47.500 --> 17:49.460
You conked out right away, too!

17:51.090 --> 17:54.210
You better not have been up to 
something last night.

17:54.540 --> 17:57.340
Like sneaking around the fridge out of hunger.

17:58.370 --> 18:01.270
I would never do such a thing!

18:05.570 --> 18:07.250
Lily-chan!

18:07.250 --> 18:08.390
Morning!

18:09.140 --> 18:10.190
Morning!

18:10.710 --> 18:12.320
Morning, Akutsu-kun.

18:13.100 --> 18:14.530
Hey. Morning.

18:15.250 --> 18:18.320
Lily-chan's walking from home with Akkun again!

18:19.030 --> 18:21.870
Why are <i>you</i> getting jelly?

18:21.870 --> 18:23.370
It's not like that!

18:24.030 --> 18:27.390
Hey, look at you two 
lovebirds in the morning!

18:27.390 --> 18:29.250
I just happened to run into her.

18:29.250 --> 18:30.500
Just happened to, huh?

18:30.500 --> 18:32.000
Let's go, Lily-chan.

18:33.150 --> 18:35.510
Hold up, Kensaku!

18:35.810 --> 18:37.370
Wait up, both of you.

18:37.370 --> 18:42.220
<i>These feelings that emerged 
in my otherwise empty heart...</i>

18:42.220 --> 18:45.230
<i>They're treasures that I've never had before.</i>

18:46.510 --> 18:49.060
<i>When I first came to this world,</i>

18:49.060 --> 18:52.500
<i>I never would have thought I'd have 
something to cherish so much.</i>

18:53.420 --> 18:58.430
<i>It's all thanks to you, Akutsu.</i>

18:59.930 --> 19:06.090
<i>I'll keep that thought to myself for now, 
glad that I have such feelings.</i>

19:14.080 --> 19:15.110
<i>But...</i>

19:15.710 --> 19:17.800
<i>But if it isn't too much...</i>

19:18.950 --> 19:24.230
<i>I would be so happy if you had 
the same feelings for me.</i>

19:25.850 --> 19:26.580
<i>Right?</i>

19:27.110 --> 19:31.510
<i>My kind, gentle, foolish demon.</i>

19:34.460 --> 19:35.660
Wait for me!

19:47.340 --> 19:48.690
Nee-san?

19:49.050 --> 19:50.090
Yeah.

19:50.090 --> 19:52.660
About that issue with Lily...

19:52.660 --> 19:54.440
There's no problem.

19:54.440 --> 19:55.130
Yeah.

19:55.630 --> 19:58.670
She was in tatters because of your baptism.

19:59.110 --> 20:03.430
She's the same old wingless.

20:04.170 --> 20:05.960
There's nothing to worry about.

20:06.300 --> 20:06.900
Yeah.

20:07.640 --> 20:08.630
Bye.

20:13.960 --> 20:15.060
Now...

20:15.700 --> 20:17.900
What's going to happen next?

21:50.990 --> 21:52.840
<i>Something's odd about this beat.</i>

22:09.540 --> 22:11.430
<i>I couldn't take my eyes off her sparkling hair.</i>

22:13.910 --> 22:17.260
<i>Her bored-looking ruby eyes.</i>

22:19.240 --> 22:23.030
<i>Her small, well-shaped nose.
Her cherry blossom-colored lips.</i>

22:24.130 --> 22:27.220
<i>That moment, I realized...</i>

22:44.910 --> 22:47.340
<i>Classes were finished, and so after school...</i>

22:47.340 --> 22:51.010
Akutsu

22:47.340 --> 22:51.010
I'm coming to your place to get it.

22:47.340 --> 22:51.010
Seriously?

22:47.340 --> 22:51.010
Just meet up at school

22:47.340 --> 22:51.010
I'm almost there

22:51.630 --> 22:52.930
Sheesh...

22:52.930 --> 22:55.730
How could I have forgotten my ribbon?

22:55.730 --> 22:57.020
What a chore.

22:58.390 --> 23:01.930
<i>I can't have him give it to me 
in class, though.</i>

23:02.460 --> 23:06.280
<i>Everyone would get the wrong idea.</i>

23:08.200 --> 23:09.800
B-Boss!

23:09.800 --> 23:11.360
Akutsu's voice.

23:12.250 --> 23:14.360
What is he screaming for?

23:15.170 --> 23:17.570
Akutsu, I came to get my ribbon.

23:19.390 --> 23:20.530
Akutsu!

23:21.230 --> 23:22.990
Were you all right?

23:32.130 --> 23:34.100
<i>Our story...</i>

23:34.100 --> 23:36.860
<i>...would remain full of chaos.</i>
